DEPENDENCIES, NOT COPIED SOURCE

  diffusers and transformers — Apache License 2.0
  torch, torchvision, torchaudio, numpy, msgspec, safetensors, PyAV and their transitive
  dependencies — their respective upstream licenses

The H3 package imports the released Diffusers implementation as a dependency. It contains no copy
or adaptation of MiniMax, ComfyUI, DiffSynth-Studio, or other community serving code. The former
`h3/h3_arch/` ComfyUI-derived GPL-3.0 port was deleted atomically with the official replacement;
no GPL-derived H3 source remains in this repository.

PACKAGE DEPENDENCIES

Cozy Runtime, Cozy Eval, TensorFS and third-party dependencies are installed from each
project's declared dependencies and exact lock. No first-party or third-party dependency
wheel is vendored in this repository. Installed distributions carry their own notices
and license files.

BUNDLED MODEL INPUT DATA

H3 bundles the minimal vocabulary, merges, tokenizer settings, and image/video processor settings
from the pinned official `MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3` snapshot. Duplicate fast-tokenizer and processor
copies were removed. These files remain governed by the upstream model repository's terms. No
model weights are stored here.

